# Gate 0 fixtures are DE-IDENTIFIED PLE transcripts. They must never enter git — a
# de-identification slip that reaches a commit is unrecoverable (history is forever, and this repo
# is mirrored to GitHub). Ignore everything in fixtures/ except the placeholder that keeps the
# directory present in a fresh clone.
fixtures/*
!fixtures/.gitkeep

# Probe run output (JSON reports written by --out) — measurements of a specific box on a specific
# day, not source. Keep them out of the repo; paste the summary into the roadmap doc instead.
out/
*.probe.json
# probe --out reports: numbers and ids only — seven integers per arm, timings, token counts and
# error stamps. Verified to contain NO free text: no rationale, no transcript, no patient_ref, not a
# single string over 60 characters. So unlike fixtures/ these are safe to commit, and they are now
# the versioned experimental record behind docs/METHODOLOGY-local-vs-sonnet.*.md and the model-axis
# rows in scripts/calibration/prompt-versions.md. They were ignored until 2026-09-04, which left the
# whole local-vs-Sonnet record one `git clean` from gone and none of its figures reproducible.
# Logs stay out — they are verbose, session-specific, and add nothing the JSON does not carry.
report/*.log
!report/*.json
